flowchart TB
  User[User asks: make a deck / sheet / report / PDF] --> Agent[Agent tool loop]
  Menu[Skill menu - enabled built-in + user skills] --> Agent
  Chosen[Skill picked in composer - pinned playbook] --> Agent
  Agent -->|matching request| UseSkill[use_skill - loads the playbook]
  Agent -->|facts first| Research[web_search / run_code]
  Agent --> Create[create_document - model writes content only]

  Create --> Check{documentsPerDay + Library storage}
  Check -->|over| Refuse[Clear message - resets or upgrade]
  Check -->|ok| Render[Render server-side: pptxgenjs, exceljs, docx, pdfkit, text]
  Render --> Store[(Supabase Storage generated-files / inline fallback)]
  Render --> Rows[(generated_files)]
  Rows --> Card[Download card under the reply - SSE file event, saved on the message]
  Rows --> Library

  subgraph Library [Library - private per user]
    Docs[Documents]
    Images[Images]
    Code[Code]
    Pages[Web pages]
    Uploads[Uploads]
  end
  Replies[Assistant replies - code, pages, images auto-saved] --> Library
  Attach[User uploads] --> Library

  subgraph skills [Skills]
    Builtin[16 built-in playbooks]
    Own[User skills - create, edit, switch off]
  end
  skills --> Menu
